OL,3,GNEWSANine Aberdeen break-ins being
OL,4,Alinked by detectives
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine Aberdeen break-ins are being
OL,7,Finvestigated by police who believe they
OL,8,Fare linked.
OL,10,FThe first incident happened on Friday
OL,11,Fevening when a property in Rosewell
OL,12,FTerrace was broken into.
OL,14,FThree suspects dressed in black and
OL,15,Fwearing balaclavas escaped with
OL,16,Fjewellery and money.
OL,18,FA further eight break-ins have happened
OL,19,Fover the weekend, and police described
OL,20,Fthe incidents as "concerning".
